# Alembic migrations

Active revisions live in `versions/`.

- `20260808_baseline_schema.py` — full schema from `src.db.models` (Postgres-ready).
- Older incomplete revisions are kept under `versions_legacy/` for history only;
  Alembic does **not** load that folder.

## Common commands

```bash
# Apply all migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Create a new revision after model changes
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe_change"
```

With Docker Compose, `scripts/docker_entrypoint.py` runs `alembic upgrade head`
automatically before starting uvicorn.
